usage: build_generated_e0_major.py [-h] [--generation-dir GENERATION_DIR]
                                   [--codegen-source-dir CODEGEN_SOURCE_DIR]
                                   [--matlab-include-dir MATLAB_INCLUDE_DIR]
                                   [--recorder-source RECORDER_SOURCE]
                                   [--post-reference-source POST_REFERENCE_SOURCE]
                                   [--build-id BUILD_ID]
                                   [--evidence-dir EVIDENCE_DIR]
                                   [--evidence-root EVIDENCE_ROOT]
                                   [--wsl-distro WSL_DISTRO]
                                   [--wsl-user WSL_USER]
                                   [--wsl-build-dir WSL_BUILD_DIR]
                                   [--record-input RECORD_INPUT]
                                   [--reference-lib REFERENCE_LIB]
